// Uses proj_no_labels created in test 03. Label-free enumeration of all
// nodes works because `nodes` (Record<1>) index is always built - it is
// NOT one of the 4 label indexes gated by the flag. This query exercises
// the path that matters for GNN training (iterate all seed nodes without
// needing a label filter).
USE proj_no_labels
MATCH (n)
RETURN count(*) AS total_nodes
